legend bottom
  |<#E1E5EA> **Gray nodes / storage** | Execution or storage environment |
  |<#006A68><color:white> **Dark teal artifacts** </color>| Deployed Wireloom material |
  |<#A9DDB8> **Green blocks** | Executing Wireloom building blocks |
  |<#FFFFFF> **White artifacts** | Consumer project, application, or RTI assets |
  |<#FFF0CD> **Amber folder** | Restored package container |
endlegend
